  "question": {
    "text": "The energy of an electron in first Bohr orbit of \\(\\mathrm{H}\\)-atom is \\(-13.6 \\mathrm{eV}\\). The possible energy value of electron in the excited state of \\(\\mathrm{Li}^{2+}\\) is",
